  "description": "Entity Framework Core support for Idora.NET's prefixed, time-ordered identifiers such as usr_01k2f9v8ta7m3x0qbrn4dzeh5c. HasIdoraKey configures a key that EF Core fills in on insert with the entity's registered prefix, sized and typed for an ASCII column; UseIdoraIds maps IdoraId properties to string columns; WhereCreatedBetween queries a key column by creation time with two index-friendly string comparisons.",
